# Sites the campaign must not stop on, named one at a time. A blanket
# -fno-sanitize=signed-integer-overflow would discard the whole bug class, and
# every entry here costs the coverage of one function, so add one only with the
# reason written down.
#
# ConVotes multiplies the page number of the `votes` command by the page size.
# The number is an rcon argument, so reaching it takes an authenticated admin,
# who has `shutdown` and `ban` anyway. AddVote caps the list at
# MAX_VOTE_OPTIONS, so no page the wrap can produce lists anything either way.
signed-integer-overflow:ConVotes
